# Unicode CLDR 47, locale pl, cldr-dates-full/main/pl/ca-gregorian.json.
# dayPeriods format-wide afternoon1 is "po południu", the phrase a speaker
# uses when placing an event; the stand-alone chart gives the bare noun
# "popołudnie", which names the part of the day itself.  Both are listed,
# with the locative the preposition governs.
po południu
popołudnie
popołudniu
